<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Input<sp/>validation</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Missing<sp/>files,<sp/>empty<sp/>content,<sp/>or<sp/>malformed<sp/>command<sp/>framing<sp/>should<sp/>report<sp/>actionable<sp/>errors.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>loader<sp/>should<sp/>preserve<sp/>original<sp/>text<sp/>for<sp/>later<sp/>processing.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Do<sp/>not<sp/>collapse<sp/>SMT<sp/>and<sp/>SAT<sp/>semantics<sp/>in<sp/>this<sp/>stage.</highlight></codeline>
