<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>SMT<sp/>result<sp/>semantics</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`SMTSolveResult`<sp/>supports<sp/>`Sat`,<sp/>`Unsat`,<sp/>and<sp/>`Unknown`.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">`SMTModel`<sp/>currently<sp/>stores<sp/>bindings<sp/>as<sp/>textual<sp/>items.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">The<sp/>model<sp/>representation<sp/>can<sp/>evolve<sp/>without<sp/>invalidating<sp/>this<sp/>basic<sp/>contract.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```text</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">class<sp/>MySMTSolver<sp/>:<sp/>public<sp/>sattyre::SMTSolver<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">public:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>void<sp/>load(const<sp/>sattyre::SMTProblem&amp;<sp/>problem)<sp/>override<sp/>{<sp/>text_<sp/>=<sp/>problem.smtlib;<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>sattyre::SMTSolveResult<sp/>solve()<sp/>override<sp/>{<sp/>return<sp/>sattyre::SMTSolveResult::Unknown;<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>sattyre::SMTModel<sp/>model()<sp/>const<sp/>override<sp/>{<sp/>return<sp/>{};<sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">private:</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>std::string<sp/>text_;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">```</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
