<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Prefer<sp/>explicit<sp/>statuses<sp/>and<sp/>deterministic<sp/>behavior.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/>Promote<sp/>examples<sp/>into<sp/>tests<sp/>when<sp/>behavior<sp/>stabilizes.</highlight></codeline>
